            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An estimation apparatus (1, 803) comprises an estimation unit (280, 832, 832a, 832b) configured to estimate a bone density of a first person based on a trained parameter (110) from input information (120, I) including first image of a first portion of a skeleton of the first person, where the first image is a plain X-ray image</p>
            </abstract>
